1
00:00:03,109 --> 00:00:05,241
The rain stops, the Sun comes back…

2
00:00:05,291 --> 00:00:06,613
and a rainbow appears!

3
00:00:06,663 --> 00:00:08,658
Where do these colors come from?

4
00:00:09,448 --> 00:00:10,514
Mila has an idea:

5
00:00:10,564 --> 00:00:12,484
run to the end of the rainbow!

6
00:00:12,534 --> 00:00:13,928
But the more she runs…

7
00:00:13,978 --> 00:00:15,570
the further away it gets.

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,867
You can't touch it.

9
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,156
Discovery mission!

10
00:00:21,672 --> 00:00:22,381
Mini mode!

11
00:00:22,431 --> 00:00:23,825
Here is a raindrop.

12
00:00:23,875 --> 00:00:25,800
A ray of sunlight goes in…

13
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:26,788
and it bends.

14
00:00:26,838 --> 00:00:29,523
It bounces off the back of the drop,

15
00:00:29,573 --> 00:00:31,701
and comes out bending again.

16
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:35,655
And each color bends a little differently!

17
00:00:35,705 --> 00:00:38,564
So the white light comes out split up:

18
00:00:38,614 --> 00:00:41,752
red, orange, yellow, green, blue, violet.

19
00:00:42,582 --> 00:00:43,871
The Sun is behind you.

20
00:00:43,921 --> 00:00:46,793
Millions of drops send their colors back to you,

21
00:00:46,843 --> 00:00:48,133
all at the same angle.

22
00:00:48,183 --> 00:00:50,142
Together, they draw a big circle…

23
00:00:50,192 --> 00:00:52,090
and the ground hides the bottom.

24
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,358
That's your rainbow!

25
00:00:54,158 --> 00:00:56,575
From above, Curio sees the whole thing:

26
00:00:56,625 --> 00:00:57,713
a complete circle!

27
00:00:57,763 --> 00:00:59,421
And it moves when you move,

28
00:00:59,471 --> 00:01:01,824
because it depends on you, on the Sun…

29
00:01:01,874 --> 00:01:02,886
and on the rain.

30
00:01:03,688 --> 00:01:05,935
That's how a rainbow forms.

31
00:01:07,188 --> 00:01:09,285
Each raindrop splits the sunlight into

32
00:01:09,335 --> 00:01:11,256
colors and sends them back to you.

33
00:01:12,022 --> 00:01:14,290
With an adult: on a very sunny day,

34
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:18,660
put the Sun behind you and make a fine spray with the garden hose.

35
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:20,166
Your very own rainbow!

36
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:22,948
And why do astronauts float?

37
00:01:22,998 --> 00:01:24,461
The answer tomorrow.
